+- AC2: Removing a v2 migration from the DB and starting the route fails with `[STARTUP-FATAL]`.
+- AC3: Modifying `routes/dispatch_v2.py` without rebuilding the artifact causes `deploy.sh` to abort.
+- AC4: CI gate: grep for `except TypeError` in `dispatch_v2.py` / `dispatch_poller_v2.py` fails build.
